---
description: >-
  Legacy v1 state diagram with the same fork/join pattern as
  should-render-forks-and-joins.mmd, but nested one level deep inside a
  composite state (TV) rather than at the diagram's top level.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  fontFamily: courier
---
stateDiagram
  [*]-->TV

  state TV {
  state fork_state &lt;&lt;fork&gt;&gt;
  [*] --> fork_state
  fork_state --> State2
  fork_state --> State3

  state join_state &lt;&lt;join&gt;&gt;
  State2 --> join_state
  State3 --> join_state
  join_state --> State4
  State4 --> [*]
  }
